{"id":"3f012d0f8371bf9a","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-supervaluation.md","title":"相对于非空经典精确化类的超赋值","display":"df-supervaluation — 相对于非空经典精确化类的超赋值","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-supervaluation","aliases":["91-df-supervaluation","91-df-supervaluation-logic"],"display":"df-supervaluation — 相对于非空经典精确化类的超赋值","depends_on":["[[91-df-classical-extension]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-supervaluation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-supervaluation</span><span>91-df-supervaluation-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-supervaluation — 相对于非空经典精确化类的超赋值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bde974325ff73b34\" href=\"?note=bde974325ff73b34\" title=\"91-df-classical-extension\">91-df-classical-extension</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bde974325ff73b34\" href=\"?note=bde974325ff73b34\" title=\"91-df-classical-extension\">91-df-classical-extension</a> 的标准部分评估；\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L_T}(v)\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L_T}(v)\\)</span>\n是指定的允许精确化类。</li>\n<li>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(w\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是固定基础模型的经典评估\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}\">\\(w:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}\\)</span>；\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 3=\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(\\mathbf 3=\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sv}_{\\mathcal E}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf3\">\\(\\operatorname{sv}_{\\mathcal E}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf3\\)</span> 是下述函数；\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L_T}_v\">\\(\\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L_T}_v\\)</span> 取全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L_T}(v)\">\\(\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L_T}(v)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supervaluation}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{sv}_{\\mathcal E}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathbf t,&amp;\\forall w\\in\\mathcal E\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t,\\\\\n\\mathbf f,&amp;\\forall w\\in\\mathcal E\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf f,\\\\\n\\mathbf u,&amp;\\text{否则}.\\end{cases}\n\\qquad \\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L_T}_v\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sv}_{\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L_T}(v)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supervaluation}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{sv}_{\\mathcal E}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathbf t,&amp;\\forall w\\in\\mathcal E\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t,\\\\\n\\mathbf f,&amp;\\forall w\\in\\mathcal E\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf f,\\\\\n\\mathbf u,&amp;\\text{否则}.\\end{cases}\n\\qquad \\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L_T}_v\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sv}_{\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L_T}(v)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>全称量化遍历允许的经典结构，而不是三值输入的组合真值表。非空前提避免空类上真假全称句同时成立。\n任何经典有效式（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\lor\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\lor\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>）超真，矛盾式超假，即使分量在原部分评估中为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span>。这说明超赋值不由分量三值决定。\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 来自一致的编码信息 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,X^-)\">\\((X,X^-)\\)</span> 时，可另取\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E=\\{w_Y:Y\\in\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathrm{VC}}(X)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal E=\\{w_Y:Y\\in\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathrm{VC}}(X)\\}\\)</span>；\n该类非空且包含于全部经典精确化类，从而同一已定义的\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sv}_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\operatorname{sv}_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span> 可适用于 VC。必须显式指定允许类，\n不能保留同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 却把全部方案等同于 VF。</p>\n<p>来源：第 18 章，印刷页 250–251，PDF 页 261–262。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-classical-extension","status":"resolved","id":"bde974325ff73b34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-classical-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-classical-extension","status":"resolved","id":"bde974325ff73b34","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$v$ 为 [[91-df-classical-extension]] 的标准部分评估；\n$\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L_T}(v)$\n是指定的允许精确化类。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L_T}(v)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"w:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf 3=\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sv}_{\\mathcal E}:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L_T}_v","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L_T}(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supervaluation}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{sv}_{\\mathcal E}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathbf t,&\\forall w\\in\\mathcal E\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t,\\\\\n\\mathbf f,&\\forall w\\in\\mathcal E\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf f,\\\\\n\\mathbf u,&\\text{否则}.\\end{cases}\n\\qquad \\operatorname{sv}^{\\mathcal L_T}_v\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sv}_{\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L_T}(v)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi\\lor\\neg\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"(X,X^-)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E=\\{w_Y:Y\\in\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathrm{VC}}(X)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sv}_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false}],"bytes":2157,"backlinks":[{"id":"0a986179bb85417f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E\\ne\\varnothing$ 为 [[91-df-supervaluation]] 的经典精确化类，$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}$。"},{"id":"bb495d7446e8fef8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E\\ne\\varnothing$ 为 [[91-df-supervaluation]] 的经典精确化类，$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}$。"},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[91-df-supervaluation]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-supervaluation]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-condi